    "detailed_description": "Use a unique chess-based move set to travel through the Dream Realm and prevent a mysterious amulet from falling into the wrong hands.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414920/extras/80dd0721ff9dab25736bcf2140b4d293.avif?t=1661717287\" /></div><br><br><i>Knightmare</i> is a mouse-controlled puzzle platformer by Jayden Hagerty (Hagertech). Explore 30 carefully crafted levels as a chess knight and save the <i>Dream Realm</i> from destruction.<br><br><strong>Slay various monsters.</strong> Each enemy has its own weaknesses.<br><strong>Experience the game in different modes.</strong> In addition to the normal way to play, there is an unlockable hard mode and speed run mode.<br><strong>Enjoy 10+ original soundtracks.</strong> Atmospheric music that adds to the experience.<br><strong>Save the <i>Dream Realm</i> from destruction.</strong> Stop The Bishop before it's too late.",
